"settings: <guimenuitem>Cookie settings</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Server "
"settings</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Security settings</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Load settings</guimenuitem>, and <guimenuitem>Search "
