#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: en/chapters/admin_guide.xml:2042
msgid ""
"Selecting one or more user groups will display the permissions for those "
"user groups, the same way they are shown in the permissions edit pages, so "
"there is no added utility in running the masks on group names. Permissions "
