msgid ""
"phpBB has a feature that allows you to put new posts in queue, where the "
"post waits until it is approved or denied by a moderator, this can be set "
"with permissions or in the <guilabel>Post settings</guilabel> for users "
"which do not have enough posts. If a moderator chooses to deny a post in the"
